WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.866
What's up guys we're Pongfinity!

00:00:05.866 --> 00:00:08.151
We're kicking off the year with something pretty extreme

00:00:08.151 --> 00:00:11.354
A lot of you guys have asked us to play on&nbsp;
a trampoline

00:00:11.354 --> 00:00:13.154
so let's jump right into it!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.785
Okay so we've made our own table tennis table

00:00:38.785 --> 00:00:40.176
from&nbsp;a wooden board

00:00:40.176 --> 00:00:42.564
and of course the Pongfinity net

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.081
It actually looks like a table!

00:00:46.455 --> 00:00:47.534
Only need the net

00:00:47.534 --> 00:00:49.967
Another great use for the pongfinity net!

00:00:59.249 --> 00:01:00.289
It's really difficult

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.101
You can move really fast&nbsp;from corner to corner

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.274
Around the net!

00:01:26.791 --> 00:01:28.115
I don't know why I did that

00:01:36.136 --> 00:01:37.705
I've been jumping for one hour now

00:01:38.653 --> 00:01:41.049
Let's go play&nbsp;some trampoline ping pong

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:42.457
Should be fun

00:01:42.953 --> 00:01:43.935
Okay Otto!

00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:47.103
It feels quite fun too!

00:02:03.942 --> 00:02:05.472
Ah, I need a break

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.569
Are you ready Sensei?

00:02:42.213 --> 00:02:44.229
I am. Is there any rules?

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.175
I feel like I'm going to lose this one

00:02:48.609 --> 00:02:51.616
He always says that!

00:02:51.616 --> 00:02:53.280
Sensei is gonna lose this one

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.560
I'm gonna lose this one

00:03:03.276 --> 00:03:05.760
"I think I'm gonna lose this one"

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.801
That was just my tactic!

00:03:33.914 --> 00:03:34.859
Hand switch

00:03:46.589 --> 00:03:47.300
I got it!

00:03:48.395 --> 00:03:49.196
Well done!

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:50.690
Nice job

00:03:55.564 --> 00:03:56.600
Another great example of

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.431
how you can use the Pongfinity net

00:03:58.431 --> 00:04:00.780
Go get yours from pongfinity.store

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:01.920
Now Miikka, let's play!

00:04:15.993 --> 00:04:17.023
Roller!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:21.992
Try and get me try and get me!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.667
If not you then your racket!

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.142
You ready for this Emil?

00:04:58.142 --> 00:04:59.840
I'm ready!

00:05:00.711 --> 00:05:01.549
Good match!

00:05:03.299 --> 00:05:04.650
Okay okay I see how it is!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.914
Those hits ain't gonna do nothing Miikka!

00:05:11.715 --> 00:05:13.025
Just when I said...

00:05:16.066 --> 00:05:17.723
That was an incredible save!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.653
Look what are you doing man?

00:05:30.106 --> 00:05:31.292
Emil are you okay?

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:34.018
Is he alive?

00:05:35.441 --> 00:05:37.558
I need a moment to recover from that

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:44.192
Okay it's time for a foampit dive battle

00:05:44.192 --> 00:05:44.895
Lets go!

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:50.864
I have a flashback

00:05:53.145 --> 00:05:55.014
I don't&nbsp;know what you're talking about

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.349
Coming!

00:06:06.778 --> 00:06:08.704
And that ball is lost forever

00:06:08.704 --> 00:06:10.619
Maybe&nbsp;not the best idea

00:06:14.646 --> 00:06:15.306
That was close

00:06:20.237 --> 00:06:21.510
Otto, you want a table?

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.353
You know, this is my kind of table tennis

00:06:25.233 --> 00:06:26.974
I don't mind it either to be honest

00:06:38.009 --> 00:06:39.815
Hahahahaa got it!

00:06:39.815 --> 00:06:41.618
Footwork wasn't&nbsp;really on point

00:06:41.878 --> 00:06:42.824
Didn't move a muscle

00:06:51.415 --> 00:06:52.371
There we go!

00:07:04.272 --> 00:07:05.593
That was pretty sick!

00:07:05.593 --> 00:07:07.582
You have promised&nbsp;the backflip so

00:07:07.582 --> 00:07:08.901
I have promised it actually

00:07:12.557 --> 00:07:13.921
How is this so difficult?

00:07:23.575 --> 00:07:24.911
The hardest shot of my life!

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.914
He's going for the big forehand

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.117
You had enough fun now?

00:07:44.949 --> 00:07:46.229
Miikka is the champion!

00:07:46.229 --> 00:07:47.936
I thought you had me there

00:07:47.936 --> 00:07:49.450
Yeah I didn't use my

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:51.769
"I think I'm gonna lose this one" -tactic

00:07:51.769 --> 00:07:53.929
so I lost that one

00:07:54.787 --> 00:07:56.115
Big thanks to Rush Helsinki

00:07:56.115 --> 00:07:57.713
for letting us come to film this video

00:07:57.713 --> 00:08:00.987
And don't forget&nbsp;to check out pongfinity.store

00:08:00.987 --> 00:08:01.994
Until next time!

